    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an all-new sequel to the party game that anyone can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a collection of 30 intuitive and easy-to-play minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend quality time with friends and family and have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Free Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a game freely and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With both competitive and cooperative games, there are lots of ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In single-player mode, record your high scores and compete against players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Party Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a selection of games to play in order, and compete to become the champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select the option to double the points in the last game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own special character with further enhanced customization features, and watch as they join the party!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an all-new sequel to the party game that anyone can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a collection of 30 intuitive and easy-to-play minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend quality time with friends and family and have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Free Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a game freely and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With both competitive and cooperative games, there are lots of ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In single-player mode, record your high scores and compete against players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Party Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a selection of games to play in order, and compete to become the champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select the option to double the points in the last game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own special character with further enhanced customization features, and watch as they join the party!</p>",
